--- !u!114 &63613735
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 63613732}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 35d11a4b863b840d7ac2ee53bce5400d, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  backgroundImage: {fileID: 1827701759}
  speakerNameText: {fileID: 492082209}
  dialogueText: {fileID: 428347004}
  fadeGroup: {fileID: 2112943811}
  textGroup: {fileID: 1827701758}
  renderTextureImage: {fileID: 1660252253}
  slideText: {fileID: 1449405043}
  skipPrompt: {fileID: 1383535362}
  slides:
  - dialogue: And so that brings us to the Battle of Casper, which in this book,
      takes place from June 1st to June 9th, 2043.
    speaker: Professor Halden
    speakerColor: {r: 1, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    backgroundSprite: {fileID: 0}
    renderTextureDisplay: {fileID: 0}
    renderTexture: {fileID: 8400000, guid: f2882666bb0e946b8975a9bb8ddaf988, type: 2}
    slideText: 'Battle of Casper





      _'
    holdTime: 5
    shake: 0
    slowZoom: 0
  - dialogue: This is often considered to be the turning point of the war in North
      America.
    speaker: Professor Halden
    speakerColor: {r: 1, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    backgroundSprite: {fileID: 0}
    renderTextureDisplay: {fileID: 0}
    renderTexture: {fileID: 8400000, guid: f2882666bb0e946b8975a9bb8ddaf988, type: 2}
    slideText: 'Battle of Casper





      _'
    holdTime: 5
    shake: 1
    slowZoom: 0
  - dialogue: We already spoke about the Battle of Signa, and how that was the turning
      point in Europe.
    speaker: Professor Halden
    speakerColor: {r: 1, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    backgroundSprite: {fileID: 0}
    renderTextureDisplay: {fileID: 0}
    renderTexture: {fileID: 8400000, guid: f2882666bb0e946b8975a9bb8ddaf988, type: 2}
    slideText: '<u>Battle of Casper</u>

      June 1-June 9, 2043




      _'
    holdTime: 5
    shake: 0
    slowZoom: 1
  - dialogue: Unlike that one, it wasn't won by someone who had to abandon their
      game dev club.
    speaker: Professor Halden
    speakerColor: {r: 1, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    backgroundSprite: {fileID: 0}
    renderTextureDisplay: {fileID: 0}
    renderTexture: {fileID: 8400000, guid: f2882666bb0e946b8975a9bb8ddaf988, type: 2}
    slideText: '<u>Battle of Casper</u>

      June 1-June 9, 2043




      _'
    holdTime: 5
    shake: 0
    slowZoom: 0
  - dialogue: I remember doing game dev...
    speaker: Wade Zunic
    speakerColor: {r: 0.53333336, g: 0.96862745, b: 1, a: 0}
    backgroundSprite: {fileID: 0}
    renderTextureDisplay: {fileID: 0}
    renderTexture: {fileID: 8400000, guid: f2882666bb0e946b8975a9bb8ddaf988, type: 2}
    slideText: '<u>Battle of Casper</u>

      June 1-June 9, 2043




      _'
    holdTime: 5
    shake: 0
    slowZoom: 1
  - dialogue: But that brave Italian general had to flee Philadelphia because of
      the Pennsbury Rebellion.
    speaker: Professor Halden
    speakerColor: {r: 1, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    backgroundSprite: {fileID: 0}
    renderTextureDisplay: {fileID: 0}
    renderTexture: {fileID: 8400000, guid: f2882666bb0e946b8975a9bb8ddaf988, type: 2}
    slideText: '<u>Battle of Casper</u>

      June 1-June 9, 2043

      Casper,
      Wyoming



      _'
    holdTime: 5
    shake: 0
    slowZoom: 0
  - dialogue: And that rebellion had spread all the way to Wyoming...
    speaker: Professor Halden
    speakerColor: {r: 1, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    backgroundSprite: {fileID: 0}
    renderTextureDisplay: {fileID: 0}
    renderTexture: {fileID: 8400000, guid: f2882666bb0e946b8975a9bb8ddaf988, type: 2}
    slideText: '<u>Battle of Casper</u>

      June 1-June 9, 2043

      Casper,
      Wyoming



      _'
    holdTime: 5
    shake: 0
    slowZoom: 0
  typeSpeed: 0.025
  fadeDuration: 0.5
